WEBVTT

01:31.942 --> 01:34.612
You always seem to know
everything, Jing.

01:34.612 --> 01:37.314
I just have a nose for treasure,
I suppose.

01:37.314 --> 01:39.339
You got some girl hidden
in this box here?

01:41.285 --> 01:43.515
Wow! This is...

01:47.725 --> 01:49.886
I can believe this is actually
one of them!

01:50.294 --> 01:51.989
It's one of the Systema Solari, which
contains the energy of the universe,

01:52.396 --> 01:53.863
the Jupiter stone!

01:54.298 --> 01:55.765
Do you mind if I touch it?

02:01.739 --> 02:03.798
So all that remains to be collected
to complete the Systema Solari

02:05.009 --> 02:08.604
are the Mercury Stone, and the ever-
important Sun Stone, right?

02:09.079 --> 02:11.172
You said I could find it in the town
of Sungria, is that right?

02:11.482 --> 02:15.384
That is the rumor, but you
won't be able to get in.

02:15.920 --> 02:17.321
Why is that?

02:17.321 --> 02:20.620
The town is run by a man
named Goblet.

02:21.458 --> 02:24.621
He has a tight hold over the entire
town and never allows any visitors.

02:25.796 --> 02:26.697
But...

02:26.697 --> 02:31.031
Don't Drop the Por Vora!

02:33.637 --> 02:36.902
All right men, step up and sign up
for the job of a lifetime!

02:37.308 --> 02:39.643
1,000 gold coins will be your reward
for almost no work at all!

02:39.643 --> 02:41.979
C'mon, don't be shy!

02:41.979 --> 02:43.380
1,000 gold coins?

02:43.380 --> 02:46.508
So, is no one going to take me up
on my offer?

02:47.952 --> 02:49.153
Count me in!

02:49.153 --> 02:49.453
What kind of work is it?
Count me in!

02:49.453 --> 02:50.654
What kind of work is it?

02:50.654 --> 02:52.022
It'll be a breeze!

02:52.022 --> 02:54.490
All you have to do is deliver
these guys to Sungria!

02:57.695 --> 02:59.162
Por Vora!

03:06.804 --> 03:09.068
Hey, what happened to everybody?

03:09.573 --> 03:11.370
I know, all it did was sneeze.

03:11.976 --> 03:14.206
You guys aren't from around here,
are you?

03:16.914 --> 03:18.677
Calm down, what are you doing?!

03:31.028 --> 03:34.293
The Por Vora are highly flammable,
explosive little creatures.

03:35.599 --> 03:40.696
Their incredible explosive powers
are used to mine jewels and ore.

03:42.673 --> 03:46.043
I can handle them, but you guys
should stay away.

03:46.043 --> 03:47.908
Didn't your mother ever tell you
not to play with fire?

03:49.113 --> 03:51.445
You guys would be better off
back on the playground.

03:51.815 --> 03:53.250
Okay, when do we get paid?

03:53.250 --> 03:55.514
You'll be paid in Sungria upon
delivery of the package.

03:56.353 --> 03:57.820
Stop right there!

04:00.658 --> 04:02.125
Hey, you guys need to be
more careful with them!

04:03.160 --> 04:04.627
I thought I told you to stop!

04:15.773 --> 04:17.365
I told you guys there's nothing
to worry about.

04:18.409 --> 04:21.478
Hey! Why are you staying
all the way out there?

04:21.478 --> 04:26.780
Jing, I can keep a better watch
over you from out here!

04:32.056 --> 04:33.523
Hey, Postino.

04:37.494 --> 04:38.961
To Sungria?

04:39.196 --> 04:41.892
Hey, you think you might be able
to take those Por Vora for us too?

04:42.266 --> 04:45.827
Sorry, but I am not permitted to
handle creatures like the Por Vora.

04:46.603 --> 04:49.197
I am prohibited from delivering
radioactive or poisonous packages.

04:51.141 --> 04:53.310
You can make an exception for us!

04:53.310 --> 04:55.212
If you're in such a hurry,

04:55.212 --> 04:57.578
why don't you deliver them
via air mail?

05:11.228 --> 05:16.598
I don't suppose there's an inn
around here that will take us?

05:17.067 --> 05:19.535
I doubt it, but now we have a good
excuse to enjoy the stars tonight.

05:30.280 --> 05:32.874
It doesn't seem like they
really trust you.

05:33.550 --> 05:37.488
I know. We've been using their race
as an alternative for dynamite.

05:37.488 --> 05:39.183
You can't really blame them
for not trusting humans.

05:41.392 --> 05:44.850
You guys have such beautiful eyes.
Go ahead and eat it all up.

05:45.562 --> 05:47.325
Don't get sick though.

06:29.506 --> 06:32.498
Looks like others have tried
to do this before us.

06:37.014 --> 06:40.551
But hey, Jing, I don't think we'll be
able to go through this way.

06:40.551 --> 06:42.119
Why not?

06:42.119 --> 06:43.916
What do you mean, why not?!

06:52.930 --> 06:55.098
It sure is shaking a lot.

06:55.098 --> 06:57.259
Not for me it isn't.

06:57.901 --> 07:01.234
C'mon, hurry up and get
over here! Slow poke!

07:01.605 --> 07:03.072
Watch your little beak there.

07:17.721 --> 07:19.188
I think we can make it.

07:34.671 --> 07:37.074
I believe you have something
that belongs to me.

07:37.074 --> 07:38.876
I'll take them from here!

07:38.876 --> 07:41.845
You sure do have impeccable
timing, don't you?

07:41.845 --> 07:43.312
Shut up!

07:51.989 --> 07:53.357
Kir, give me a hand!

07:53.357 --> 07:54.824
What do you want me to do?!

07:55.492 --> 07:56.823
What are you guys doing?!

08:02.666 --> 08:04.190
Kir Royale!

08:21.084 --> 08:22.551
Greedy little kids...

08:28.525 --> 08:30.720
Only one left now,
guess it'll have to do.

08:31.328 --> 08:33.091
Hey, sister!

08:36.934 --> 08:38.702
You're still alive?!

08:38.702 --> 08:40.431
I thought you died in the explosion.

08:41.004 --> 08:43.165
We learned that one back
on the playground.

08:44.641 --> 08:46.302
I see.

08:47.110 --> 08:50.910
I'm always quick on my toes
when it comes to my work.

08:51.481 --> 08:53.540
Were you just going to leave
without this one?

09:07.764 --> 09:09.129
Thanks a lot.

09:18.008 --> 09:19.176
Hey, sister...

09:19.176 --> 09:20.803
Izarra Danbura.

09:21.912 --> 09:23.981
We'll split the cash fifty-fifty, okay?

09:23.981 --> 09:27.849
I'm not too worried about the money.
We just have to stay alive.

09:29.252 --> 09:32.255
Hey, Izarra, have you ever
heard that danger

09:32.255 --> 09:35.247
can often bring two lovers together?

09:35.726 --> 09:39.096
I think, in this case, it is you and I
who are those two lovers.

09:39.096 --> 09:41.462
You want to add some more danger
and test your theory?

09:41.832 --> 09:45.268
No, no, I can live with being
just friends for now.

09:48.171 --> 09:51.608
My trail of tears in this godforsaken
land has been long and hard.

09:51.608 --> 09:53.872
Until now, I've always been alone.

09:54.845 --> 09:57.177
What am I going to do
with these guys?

10:03.053 --> 10:05.146
It looks like they have
a new best friend.

10:05.722 --> 10:07.781
I think they're hungry.

10:15.932 --> 10:19.493
You ready? We're about to hit
the hardest barrier yet.

10:21.672 --> 10:25.301
Here lie the swirling magma and
scorching hot winds of Hell,

10:26.009 --> 10:27.476
the Venus Pit.

10:43.126 --> 10:44.593
It's hot!

10:55.038 --> 10:56.767
The magma here is alive.

10:57.240 --> 10:59.743
They say this special metal
is a shape memory alloy.

10:59.743 --> 11:03.201
They all melt together and rid
themselves of impurities.

11:03.613 --> 11:05.376
The lava has a memory?

11:05.849 --> 11:07.651
So, I guess it wouldn't all just
turn into normal metal

11:07.651 --> 11:09.949
if water was poured all over it.

11:10.721 --> 11:12.211
Or so it would seem.

11:25.502 --> 11:26.969
What was that?!

11:27.370 --> 11:31.067
This is an ice bullet that was made
from the ice of a glacier.

11:31.508 --> 11:33.305
So, it's an actual bullet made of ice?

11:39.015 --> 11:41.984
Hey, Jing! The Por Vora
are freaking out!

11:42.619 --> 11:44.086
Okay! Let's go!

11:50.994 --> 11:52.461
Almost there...

12:03.507 --> 12:05.236
I can't die here.

12:05.542 --> 12:08.278
I'm not going to let this thing take me!

12:08.278 --> 12:09.745
I won't let you die.

12:25.128 --> 12:26.595
What do you think you're doing?!

12:29.132 --> 12:30.200
Jing!

12:30.200 --> 12:31.690
No!

12:34.971 --> 12:36.438
Por Vora!

13:07.204 --> 13:08.831
She gave her life for us.

13:22.652 --> 13:24.586
I scribbled this in when
I was just a kid.

13:25.856 --> 13:27.756
I still love you, Daddy.

13:28.992 --> 13:31.961
But you were never happy, Daddy.

13:33.029 --> 13:34.997
And I never let you forget that.

13:36.533 --> 13:39.832
But now you're getting me back
for all of that.

13:40.804 --> 13:42.601
So is that a memento for you?

13:43.273 --> 13:45.605
He was killed by a business rival.

13:55.285 --> 13:57.378
Papa!

13:58.355 --> 14:03.156
Ever since then, I have been on
a journey to find my father's killer.

14:05.362 --> 14:08.525
My trail of tears through
this godforsaken land

14:09.432 --> 14:11.525
has been long and hard, but finally,

14:13.169 --> 14:17.128
I have learned of his whereabouts.

14:17.841 --> 14:19.308
He's in that town!

14:22.012 --> 14:25.641
So that's Sungria? What's his name?

14:27.984 --> 14:29.451
Goblet!

14:41.064 --> 14:43.089
"I could steal the sun if I wanted to!"

14:43.533 --> 14:46.331
That's what that damn
Bandit King said?

14:47.971 --> 14:49.572
I don't know the first thing about him,

14:49.572 --> 14:51.164
but he won't get away with even
stealing one cockroach from me!

14:52.542 --> 14:56.000
It is I who can have anything
I desire, not him!

15:00.417 --> 15:03.086
They said that no one could ever find

15:03.086 --> 15:06.419
the sacred Sun and Mercury Stones
of the Systema Solari,

15:07.724 --> 15:10.352
but I already have the Mercury Stone!

15:12.095 --> 15:13.892
All I have left to find
is the Sun Stone.

15:15.498 --> 15:17.591
I am confident that it
will soon be mine!

15:23.907 --> 15:25.670
You only have one of the small ones.

15:26.242 --> 15:27.944
You were supposed to have two!

15:27.944 --> 15:29.411
What do you expect us to
do with just one kid?!

15:29.946 --> 15:31.348
Well, how much can we get
for just the one?

15:31.348 --> 15:32.815
How much is it going to be?

15:35.318 --> 15:37.286
You can exchange your
Por Vora for money.

15:37.954 --> 15:40.857
Go to the mining office.
They'll take care of you.

15:40.857 --> 15:42.347
Got it.

15:53.603 --> 15:55.093
I guess that's the office.

16:01.611 --> 16:03.380
Where are you going?!

16:03.380 --> 16:04.847
Got work to do.

16:10.086 --> 16:12.088
What are you doing coming to me?

16:12.088 --> 16:13.612
It seems like she likes you.

16:14.324 --> 16:16.155
Adios amigo!

16:20.930 --> 16:22.397
Jing!

16:41.251 --> 16:42.718
That's got to be the Mercury Stone.

16:43.153 --> 16:45.883
The Sun Stone can't be
found without it.

16:46.322 --> 16:47.789
Let's go get it.

16:48.858 --> 16:50.325
After you...

16:51.928 --> 16:53.630
What's wrong?

16:53.630 --> 16:55.632
I'm going to go look for the light
of my hope real quick.

16:55.632 --> 16:58.328
All I can see now is the darkness
of your desire.

16:59.803 --> 17:02.795
Your mom killed herself to save me.

17:03.239 --> 17:05.799
Why did she do it?
I just don't get it.

17:09.179 --> 17:10.346
You idiots!

17:10.346 --> 17:12.282
Stop goofing off!

17:12.282 --> 17:14.750
I ordered the extra Por Vora
that you needed.

17:15.351 --> 17:18.377
Find that Sun Stone, or else!

17:33.603 --> 17:35.400
I'll get him, Papa.

17:53.623 --> 17:56.524
I wonder how long that
light of hope will last?

17:57.093 --> 17:59.653
I guess it will last until
the power goes out.

18:01.364 --> 18:05.095
This time you won't get away,
Senore Goblet!

18:06.035 --> 18:07.696
Who the hell are you?

18:08.104 --> 18:10.436
You are the business rival
that ended his life!

18:11.207 --> 18:13.437
I am the daughter of
Shaltoryuz Danbura!

18:13.743 --> 18:15.335
Danbura's daughter!

18:16.279 --> 18:17.347
With my father's gun,

18:17.347 --> 18:18.905
I will give you the same fate
that you gave him!

18:21.251 --> 18:23.617
Hey, get out of the way!

18:24.988 --> 18:26.455
I told you to get out of the way!

18:27.657 --> 18:30.023
I guess you'll just have
to shoot her too.

18:32.395 --> 18:34.727
I think I'll just go ahead and
kill you both instead!

18:39.135 --> 18:41.194
Don't look at me with those eyes!
I can't...

18:41.905 --> 18:46.239
But my whole life has been in
preparation for this moment.

18:46.876 --> 18:48.844
I must shoot, but I can't.

18:49.279 --> 18:51.080
But this is the whole
reason for which

18:51.080 --> 18:52.638
I have spread my trail of tears
along this godforsaken land.

18:57.220 --> 18:58.687
Jing!

18:59.722 --> 19:04.523
I don't care if you kill him,

19:05.662 --> 19:07.789
but I can not allow you
to harm the Por Vora.

19:10.667 --> 19:12.134
Jing!

19:13.069 --> 19:14.434
Don't worry.

19:19.142 --> 19:24.045
Hey! Did you really think you

19:24.480 --> 19:27.677
could hurt Jing with
an old gun like that?

19:28.551 --> 19:32.544
My Mercury Stone! You bastard,
you must be the Bandit King!

19:32.989 --> 19:35.184
Jing is the Bandit King?!

19:35.825 --> 19:37.460
Yeah, you just hit this
with your bullet.

19:37.460 --> 19:38.927
Try pushing it in the middle.

20:03.486 --> 20:05.317
What the...

20:06.289 --> 20:08.120
The Mercury Stone and the Jupiter
stones are the two switches

20:08.558 --> 20:11.789
of the Systema Solari that make
the Sun Stone appear.

20:12.695 --> 20:16.062
They only exist to awaken
the Sun Stone.

20:17.500 --> 20:19.369
We also owe a lot to the Por Vora,

20:19.369 --> 20:21.394
who were willing to part with
the Sun Stone.

20:23.139 --> 20:25.664
I've lost everything.

20:38.655 --> 20:40.122
Jing...

20:41.691 --> 20:43.818
How do you feel about becoming
her new mother?

20:44.327 --> 20:46.591
But I...

20:47.297 --> 20:51.461
Don't worry about it.
She still needs a mother.

20:53.002 --> 20:54.469
You can see that, right?

20:57.173 --> 20:58.574
Jing!

20:58.574 --> 21:00.201
Good luck with her!

21:05.615 --> 21:07.350
How is this happening?

21:07.350 --> 21:11.548
I'm crying, but they are not
tears of sadness.

21:13.556 --> 21:15.421
For the first time in my life,
I am crying tears of joy.

21:17.727 --> 21:20.594
I suppose not all the tears in this
godforsaken land are bad.

21:27.837 --> 21:31.739
This land of tears certainly
is a strange place.
